Output out/d-multiformat.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1500
Set Height 660
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/bin:$PATH; clear" Enter
Show

Type "# one stream: Spark, Hadoop, Kafka, Airflow, klog, logfmt, JSON" Sleep 1s Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "cat mixed.log" Enter
Sleep 3500ms
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "loglens --color mixed.log" Enter
Sleep 5s
